    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p>Mythica Adventures pre-order<br>Join the family and be part of the game all over the world forever.<br>The biggest fans supporting this project will become part of the game in the form of exclusive collecting cards, which will be placed to be found in the game.<br>Check out the various options and choose how you can support us and receive amazing gadgets.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/3160dadf7a57e78c27d200325e9b47f2.avif?t=1669916168\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The warrior elven <strong>Xyrra</strong> must get to the mountains to free her sister, who has been kidnapped and imprisoned in the dungeon.<br>She is held by a bloodthirsty demon who manages a horde of evil creatures.<br>Complete levels, collect artifacts, defeat the Demon and free your sister.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/45c2af794690b85c68feade01527ffe6.avif?t=1669916168\" /></div><br><br>Classic 2D arcade platform game. Sword fight with monsters and the final fight with the Evil Demon.<br>There are 3 stages, each in a different world / scenery. Explore forest, mountains and lava world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/c7185a3876a61e8f7e7bc4509e73ad31.poster.avif?t=1669916168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/c7185a3876a61e8f7e7bc4509e73ad31.webm?t=1669916168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/c7185a3876a61e8f7e7bc4509e73ad31.mp4?t=1669916168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hunt down the beasts and search for lost treasures.<br>at the beginning you will see an epic intro which will introduce you to the mystery world of Mythica.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/fddabb47b866e8a50d1bb8f7ef17d4f1.avif?t=1669916168\" /></div><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect Unique Cards<br></li><li>Collect  Elven tokens as Many as Possible<br></li><li>Defeat Your Enemies With Swords and Magic<br></li><li>Show your dexterity and overcome various levels</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662820/extras/4f635cca58a53b65e8ae55d667c22dd6.avif?t=1669916168\" /></div>",
